voidwm (1.0.2) stable; urgency=medium

  * Retheme: switch default "ember" palette to "nightfall" -- dark
    indigo/violet glass, styled after BazziteOS's GNOME desktop
    (bar, dock, titlebars, borders, accent all repainted).
  * No functional/behavioral changes.

